# Line endings, which matter here for exactly one reason worth writing down.
#
# ApiSurface/*.txt is the committed public-API baseline (§32), and its whole
# value is that the DIFF IS THE REVIEW. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf
# rewriting it to CRLF would make a regeneration on that machine look like a
# six-hundred-line change with nothing in it, which is the same failure §32.3
# rejected the XAML compiler's generated types for: a baseline that cries wolf
# is a baseline somebody approves without reading.
#
# ApiSurfaceTests normalises line endings before comparing, so this is not what
# makes the test pass on Windows - it is what keeps the artefact under review
# readable when it does. Added with the CI matrix in §35, since before that no
# Windows machine ever touched these files.
* text=auto

tests/EmuSen.LunaP.Tests/ApiSurface/*.txt text eol=lf

# Shell scripts and workflows are read by bash on every runner.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
